%% 文档状态：历史 Round O3/O12 实现切片；不代表当前完整任务架构。
%% 当前整体边界以 ARCHITECTURE.md 和 docs/mcp_v1.md 为准。
%% O3 状态刷新时序（合成期列表订阅）
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant A as app.do_synthesis
    participant SS as SynthesisService._run
    participant Q as queue.synthesize_project
    participant P as lib.progress
    participant UI as 合成Tab(s_log / s_queue_list)

    U->>A: 点「开始合成」
    A->>A: state=SynthesisState(...); state.segment_states=build_segment_states(proj)
    A->>SS: start(state, project, bindings, ...)
    SS->>Q: synthesize_project(..., cb_seg_state=update_segment_state)
    loop 每 0.5s 轮询 + 每生成一段
        Q->>Q: tts_engine.synthesize_segment(seg)
        Q->>P: cb_seg_state(seg_id, "done", 1.0)
        P-->>SS: state.segment_states[seg_id] 更新
        A->>A: time.sleep(0.5)
        A->>UI: yield (snapshot_text(), to_queue_rows(state.segment_states))
    end
    Note over UI: s_queue_list 展示 ✅/⏳/❌ + 进度%；s_log 同步文本
    Note over A: 终态(done/cancelled/error) 再 yield 一次收尾

%% O12 暂停/恢复时序（段边界协作挂起）
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant A as app.pause_synthesis / resume_synthesis
    participant S as SynthesisService
    participant R as _run(worker线程)
    participant Q as queue.synthesize_project

    U->>A: 点「⏸ 暂停」
    A->>S: pause(state)
    S->>S: state.paused=True; state.status="paused"
    Note over R: 段边界 `while state.paused and not state.cancel: sleep(0.1)` 挂起
    R->>Q: 不再调 next(gen) -> 进行中段跑完即停、停止提交新段
    A->>A: yield (gr.update(), to_queue_rows) -> UI 显示 ⏸
    U->>A: 点「▶ 恢复」
    A->>S: resume(state)
    S->>S: state.paused=False; state.status="running"
    R->>Q: 退出挂起，继续 next(seg) 合成
    Q->>Q: 后续段继续 -> 完成 -> state.status="done"
